{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923130/extras/cfc2ade3d43aadd91323d4324ba48b53.poster.avif?t=1760453404\" width=540 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923130/extras/cfc2ade3d43aadd91323d4324ba48b53.webm?t=1760453404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923130/extras/cfc2ade3d43aadd91323d4324ba48b53.mp4?t=1760453404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw bombs and charge ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this stage-clearing action game packed with respect for 80\u2019s arcades, rescue the lady imprisoned in the factory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero is a cute yet tough bipedal cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride the nostalgic tones of the 1980s as you infiltrate a dangerous bomb factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage is filled with unique gimmicks that will test your judgment and action skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy four computer terminals with the bombs placed around the stage to disable the barrier \u2014 then deliver the finishing blow to the boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rest assured \u2014 the controls and speed are tuned to 21st-century standards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a fresh bomb-throwing action experience that fuses retro visuals with modern gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923130/extras/235441daa41cddc5bf9ff18c89d80be2.avif?t=1760453404\" width=520 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3923130?t=